#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:5 7d31133afde3497d8fb2f1dde0d50db0
msgid "RC Input Channel Mapping (RCMAP)"
msgstr "RC 输入通道映射（RCMAP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:7 86dd1ec9065e4219ba6eeff06c36bdb4
msgid ""
"This article shows how to set up a non-standard RC input channel mapping "
"using the RCMAP feature."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 RCMAP 功能设置非标准 RC 输入通道映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:11 14a097d639b74258a6dce71e37dc81b4
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:13 178fe7ff657d410482ef8b41db09976d
msgid "By default the RC input channels are:"
msgstr "默认情况下，RC 输入通道为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:16 16455041e64a48b1b58222faba27a3ae
msgid "Channel 1: Pitch input"
msgstr "通道 1：俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:17 df7011ddc692485482e26a5bc2355e39
msgid "Channel 2: Roll input"
msgstr "通道 2：横滚输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:18 0a3e2945ef244ed882bddc7785603aa5
msgid "Channel 3: Throttle input (vertical)"
msgstr "通道 3：油门输入（垂直）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:19 9ce8c7d9519b41ed93d6661b02a48c6a
msgid "Channel 4: Yaw input"
msgstr "通道4：偏航输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:20 88939d9c06f3473c81da2224366f80b0
msgid "Channel 5: Forward input"
msgstr "通道 5：前进输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:21 79e1193a84c5418eba4a410b9e868afc
msgid "Channel 6: Lateral input"
msgstr "通道 6：侧移输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:24 15e274a2084b41c0a09b4f4e6957a8c6
msgid ""
"These can be changed by setting the :ref:`RCMAP_FORWARD <RCMAP_FORWARD>`, "
":ref:`RCMAP_LATERAL <RCMAP_LATERAL>`, :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`RCMAP_PITCH <RCMAP_PITCH>`, :ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` and"
" :ref:`RCMAP_YAW <RCMAP_YAW>` parameters using the *Mission Planner*'s "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree** (or Full Parameter List) as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"可通过 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree**（或完整参数列表）设置"
" :ref:`RCMAP_FORWARD <RCMAP_FORWARD>`、:ref:`RCMAP_LATERAL "
"<RCMAP_LATERAL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`、:ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` 参数来更改上述通道映射，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:29 7d533d6e5ddd457caddd53d1a3a055de
msgid ""
"After changing any of these parameters the autopilot should be rebooted."
msgstr "修改上述任何参数后，应重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:34 f405e98da4c7498989b9303b240bf283
msgid ""
"Additional information about the ``RCMAP`` parameters can be found in the "
":ref:`Parameters <sub:RCMAP_ROLL>` reference."
msgstr "关于 ``RCMAP`` 参数的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`参数 <sub:RCMAP_ROLL>` 参考手册。"

